    "body": "This worker stopped before claiming and added the `blocked` label. This issue waits for `#2238`.\n\nThe maintainer ordered that `#2238` finishes steps 1 and 2 before `#2246` starts.\n\nCurrent state on GitHub:\n- `#2238` is open and claimed at `2026-11-16T19:31Z` (`issue-worker-max`).\n- No PR exists for `#2238` yet.\n- PR `#2243` (which `#2238` stacks on) is still open against `main`.\n\nThis worker created no branch, no worktree, no code change, and no PR. Remove `blocked` when `#2238` delivers the measurement probe and the cache rule.\n",
