    "body": "fix on issue/2246-area-preview-fill · PR #2255 (stacked on #2254) · head f6c7f605f981f3f85b974ab353231bd5bc60d083 · pinned by `frame_cost_probe::still_frames_on_fig8_name_their_costs`, `frame_cost_probe::area_preview_fill_is_made_once_per_draft` · merges when reviewed\n\nRelease, fig8 state c: still frame 30.0 ms -> 14.8 ms (scene 18.20 -> 2.76 ms).\n\nTest build: `.claude/tmp/test-builds/camcraft-2246-f6c7f605f.exe`. To see the fix:\n1. Open `testdata/models/fig8.step`.\n2. Add a 2D Adaptive operation on a welded face. Set Containment to Outside.\n3. Open the Boundary group and turn the view. The frame rate stays smooth while the orange area shows.\n",
